00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.440
But we grew up with printers.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.120
I've been a printer
guy for a long time.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:25.260
We grew up with printers
but we are much, much more.

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:28.090
Zebra is an end-to-end
solution company.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.160
Take a look at
