00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:48.560
So, basically, some apps
that has been loaded

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:52.040
and one very important
one is a ZPL engine,

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.390
which is how you connect
to the underneath engine

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:57.800
of the printer.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:21:00.350
Victor was mentioning it.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:05.090
So we have this Google
Cloud agent, the second one

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:07.550
on the right, and
which, in fact,

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:11.390
allow you to publish and
